# The review of step 23, the golden screens: the dialogs of screens 2a to
# 2d are the application's own frames, so a change to the answers it
# offers, their order, their labels, the dialog's chrome or its fitting to
# the window changes a reference screen. Before, the screens drew the
# dialogs from the views with the test's own answer list and every row of
# detail, and none of these was compared.

